  "description": "DOBQOE crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C22 H63 Ce6 N44 O14,0.46(Br9 Pb2),2.5(C2 H4 N4),Br6 Pb1,3.8(Br1),3.6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 4 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce2G (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce3G (Ce) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.714-3.850 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.81-119.71°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ce6(μ3-OH)8(BrPbBr5)(μ2-4-NH2-1,2,4-Triaz)11.5(OH2)6][Pb0.84Br4.2][Br]3.8·2(4-NH2-1,2,4-Triaz)·3.6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
